# Binary assets: never normalise line endings, never diff as text.
#
# Every image here is base64-inlined into the bundles, so a single flipped
# byte becomes a broken picture on the live site. A merge on 2026-10-09
# did exactly that to 49 files (0D 0A inside PNG/JPEG data rewritten as 0A)
# and the repo had nothing telling Git — or a careless script — that these
# are not text. Now it does.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
